 "texts": [
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 145,
   "text": "ACCESSIBILITY STATEMENT",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 165,
   "text": "Effective date: August 1, 2026",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 212,
   "text": "OUR COMMITMENT",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 232,
   "text": "L. Therese White is committed to making theresewhite.com usable by as many people as possible, including people with disabilities. Accessible design is consistent with the work we do: making it possible for people to be heard and understood.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 321,
   "text": "THE STANDARD WE WORK TOWARD",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 361,
   "text": "We aim to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 at Level AA. These guidelines are the widely recognized standard for making web content perceivable, operable, understandable, and robust.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 431,
   "text": "We describe this as a goal we are actively working toward rather than a completed state. Accessibility is ongoing work, and we review this site periodically.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 492,
   "text": "WHAT WE HAVE DONE",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 512,
   "text": "Measures we have taken to improve accessibility on this site include:",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 540,
   "text": "Using a clear heading structure so screen reader users can navigate by section-",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 568,
   "text": "Providing text alternatives for images that carry meaning",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 596,
   "text": "Working toward sufficient color contrast between text and background",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 624,
   "text": "Supporting keyboard navigation throughout the site",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 652,
   "text": "Writing link text that makes sense when read on its own",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 680,
   "text": "Keeping the site usable across a range of screen sizes and zoom levels",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 727,
   "text": "KNOWN LIMITATIONS",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 747,
   "text": "We want to be straightforward about the areas where this site does not yet meet our goal:",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 775,
   "text": "Third-party content. Some features, including embedded video players, scheduling tools, and social media content, are provided by other companies. We do not control their accessibility, though we consider accessibility when choosing vendors.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 859,
   "text": "Platform constraints. This site is built on the Wix platform, and some of the underlying code is generated by the platform rather than written by us.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 929,
   "text": "We are working to address these.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 963,
   "text": "ALTERNATIVE WAYS TO GET WHAT YOU NEED",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1002,
   "text": "If any part of this site is not accessible to you, we will provide the information or service another way. We can:",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1044,
   "text": "- Send content by email in a format that works for you",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1100,
   "text": "There is no charge for this, and you do not need to explain why you need it.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1147,
   "text": "TELL US ABOUT A PROBLEM",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1167,
   "text": "We welcome your feedback on the accessibility of this site. If you run into a barrier, please tell us.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1195,
   "text": "Email:",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "a",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1195,
   "text": "Therese@ThereseWhite.com",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1209,
   "text": "It helps if you can describe the page you were on, what you were trying to do, and what went wrong. If you know the browser and any assistive technology you were using, please include that as well.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1265,
   "text": "We aim to respond to accessibility feedback within [NUMBER] business days.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1313,
   "text": "IF YOU ARE NOT SATISFIED WITH OUR RESPONSE",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1352,
   "text": "If you contact us about an accessibility barrier and are not satisfied with how we respond, you may escalate by emailing [EMAIL ADDRESS] with \"Accessibility Escalation\" in the subject line. You also retain any rights you have under the Americans with Disabilities Act, the California Unruh Civil Rights Act, and other applicable law.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1469,
   "text": "HOW THIS STATEMENT WAS PREPARED",
   "size": "14px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-mtatf9sh",
   "y": 1508,
   "text": "This statement is based on a self-evaluation of the site. It was last reviewed on August 1, 2026.",
   "size": "10px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "footer",
   "y": 1586,
   "text": "L. Therese White",
   "size": "15px",
